---
title: SD-05 Sales - Confirm Sale (POS with FEFO)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Sales Clerk
    participant F as Frontend (POS)
    participant A as Sales API
    participant S as SalesService
    participant D as SQL Server
    C->>F: Confirm cart
    F->>A: POST /api/sales (items, JWT)
    A->>S: CreateSale(dto, clerkId)
    S->>S: Validate items, qty > 0, price > 0
    S->>D: BEGIN TRANSACTION, load non-expired batches (FEFO)
    D-->>S: Batches ordered by expiry date
    alt Stock insufficient
        S->>D: ROLLBACK
        S-->>A: Insufficient stock error
        A-->>F: 400 "Only X units available"
        F-->>C: Show error
    else Enough stock
        S->>S: Allocate earliest-expiring batches first
        S->>D: Insert Sale, SaleItems (price snapshot), SaleItemBatches
        S->>D: Update batch quantities + insert StockMovement (-qty)
        S->>D: COMMIT
        S-->>A: Invoice
        A-->>F: 201 Created + invoice
        F-->>C: Show receipt
    end
    Note over S,D: Sale and stock update are one atomic transaction
